# Every companion builds from the repository root, so this file bounds both
# what the daemon receives and what a companion Dockerfile is able to COPY
# into a published, publicly pullable image.
#
# Only paths no companion build needs. companions/buildspec_test.go fails if a
# pattern here would exclude a Dockerfile, a COPY source, or the staged CLI
# binary, so an entry that breaks a build cannot land.
.git
target
code/testdata
